WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.001 --> 00:00:04.206
Ringo checked Bot.

2
00:00:04.207 --> 00:00:11.086
"Hmm. This microchip is broken," he said.

3
00:00:11.087 --> 00:00:15.947
"What happened?"

4
00:00:15.948 --> 00:00:18.975
Gaston checked Bot too.

5
00:00:18.976 --> 00:00:24.052
"Did a magnet beam hit her?" he asked.

6
00:00:24.053 --> 00:00:27.614
"Yes," Ringo said.

7
00:00:27.615 --> 00:00:35.772
"Magnet beams can hurt old robots," Gaston said.

8
00:00:35.773 --> 00:00:43.589
Gaston found a new microchip for Bot.

9
00:00:43.590 --> 00:00:49.947
Ringo put it in.

10
00:00:49.948 --> 00:00:54.225
Bing! "Hello!" Bot said.

11
00:00:54.226 --> 00:00:59.748
Ringo and Gaston laughed.

12
00:00:59.749 --> 00:01:03.358
Gaston led them to a room.

13
00:01:03.359 --> 00:01:08.735
Ringo saw two red Astro bikes.

14
00:01:08.736 --> 00:01:12.239
"Whoa! Cool!" he said.

15
00:01:12.240 --> 00:01:15.325
Gaston chuckled.

16
00:01:15.326 --> 00:01:18.092
"I love Astro bikes.

17
00:01:18.093 --> 00:01:22.265
I used to race them."

18
00:01:22.266 --> 00:01:27.009
Ringo asked Gaston about the missing bike.

19
00:01:27.010 --> 00:01:30.192
"It's red too," Gaston said.

20
00:01:30.193 --> 00:01:32.842
"But it's super fast."

21
00:01:32.843 --> 00:01:35.049
He frowned.

22
00:01:35.050 --> 00:01:39.473
"That's why someone stole it."

23
00:01:39.474 --> 00:01:41.392
Bot nodded.

24
00:01:41.393 --> 00:01:46.433
"Somebody wants it for the race," she said.

25
00:01:46.434 --> 00:01:50.207
Ringo looked at Gaston.

26
00:01:50.208 --> 00:01:54.023
"I think I have a plan," Ringo said.

27
00:01:54.024 --> 00:01:56.871
"Gaston, can you help me?

28
00:01:56.872 --> 00:01:59.558
I want to make something."

29
00:01:59.559 --> 00:02:02.198
"Sure," Gaston said.

30
00:02:02.199 --> 00:02:05.067
Ringo smiled. "Great!

31
00:02:05.068 --> 00:02:06.757
And one other thing . . .

32
00:02:06.758 --> 00:02:13.158
Can I use an Astro bike?"

